{"version":1,"content":"<p>今晚（18日）10時許，警方於尖沙嘴發現一輛保時捷私家車行駛時左搖右擺，遂於碧仙桃道近麼地道將車輛截停。</p><p>警員在車內檢獲半枝懷疑大麻，隨即為司機進行藥物及酒精等測試。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T03:38:55.145222+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":83,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-18T15:56:47+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T03:37:34.308284+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T03:37:34.308284+00:00","content_hash":"9292f7f2af5a629b0b1a798a4e8c3b1fee5ad06557595b7fd449a4b5e2685532","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}